                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wana wa Reubeni, na wana wa Gadi na hiyo nusu ya kabila ya Manase, wakavuka, hali ya kuvaa silaha mbele ya wana wa Israeli, kama Musa alivyowaambia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "walipata kama watu arobaini elfu hesabu yao, wenye kuvaa silaha tayari kwa vita, waliovuka mbele ya BWANA, waende vitani, hata nchi tambarare za Yeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
